               .direct("What did {V} say about the doorbell recording?", "\"{V} said it was frightening to hear it come over the speaker at the door. {V.He} had never been threatened before.\""),
                    .cross("{DL} walked away.", "\"{DL} walked away only after saying what {D.he} came to say.\""),
               .cross("No weapon.", "\"No. There was no weapon of any kind.\""),
               .cross("You cannot say that {V} was the tipster?", "\"I cannot. Animal services does not tell us who calls, and {V} does not tell us. It matters because {DL} believed it.\""),
               .cross("{DL} did not touch {V}, did {D.he}?", "\"No. {DL} did not touch {V} and did not step inside. There was no weapon.\""),
