        allocution: "\"I went to my neighbor's door to ask if {V.he} had called in the tip, and I was angry. I said something about the dogs that I should not have said. I'm sorry for scaring {V.him} in {V.his} own doorway. I'll stay away from {V.him} and keep my temper in check.\"",
        truths: ("{DL} had texted a friend {V}'s address and \"handle this.\"",
                 "{DL} had come to apologize, and the words came out when {V} slammed the door, the full video shows."),
