               .direct("What did you say first?", "\"That I came to apologize for how I acted at the shelter. {V.He} slammed the door, and that is when I lost my temper.\""),
               .direct("Did you send {V}'s address to anyone?", "\"I texted a friend the address because I wanted to know who lived there. I wrote 'handle this,' and I meant talk to {V.him}, not hurt {V.him}.\""),
               .direct("What happened after you said it?", "\"{V} closed the door and I went back to my car. I sat there and wished I had said nothing.\""),
               .direct("Did you go back to {V}'s house?", "\"No. I never went back, and I never called. I left it alone after that day.\""),
                    .cross("'The same hole as those dogs.'", "\"I know how it sounds.\""),
